<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The Floating Fortress of Grayskull</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;"Beneath Mystacor, there are many secret tunnels and rooms, forgotten and sealed off. No one has been able to access them in centuries, but there are whispers of what they contain."&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The friends of Mara at Arxia Station gamble everything on untested and dangerous technology for a straw's chance in hell, i.e. they have to bring Adora with them into Despondos and hide her somewhere safe so the First One's wont just replace Mara with the next one, use her to pull Etheria back out of Despondos (which for the purposes of this fic they could) and start over.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>itsaboringname</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Original Female Character(s)/Original Male Character(s)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Encyclica</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Unther</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentioned Adora (She-Ra) - Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentioned Mara (She-ra) - Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Darla | Mara's Ship (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Eternians</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>The Etherians</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Grayskull as a rebellion against Eternia</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>End of a War</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Origin Story</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Heart of Etheria (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Portals</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Love can be crazy science in a crumbling bunker under siege while the world is ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Pre-Canon</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Gen</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Ambiguous/Open Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Height Differences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>I wrote this instead of finishing my ck3 mod :(</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Again</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentioned Light Hope</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
      <dc:publisher>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Archive of Our Own</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
